{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40477","headline":"将入关行次湘阴 · 曹松","name":"将入关行次湘阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"背顾秦城在何处，图书作伴过湘东。\n神鵶乱噪黄陵近，候鴈斜沈梦泽空。\n打桨天连晴水白，烧田云隔夜山红。\n也知渐老岩栖稳，争奈文闱有至公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}